{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ENddF4Gh6XG3HcY38Z2fL3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the log level settled on for the message recommending users switch off the classic consumer group rebalance protocol in the first phase of deprecation is **INFO**.\\\\n\\\\nThis is found in the discussion thread for KIP-1274. In a message from Lianet Magrans on February 16, 2026, she responds to Matthias Sax's question about Phase 1 logging:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"About phase 1: I think the main goal at this point is to clearly communicate the recommendation in applications not using the new protocol. We can achieve that via an info message (and introduce the warn when we deprecate, as in the KIP), so agreed. Updated phase 1 with this.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nShe confirms that Phase 1 would use an INFO level log to communicate the recommendation to users, with the WARN level being introduced in Phase 2 when the protocol is officially deprecated.\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-16-mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md`\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-23-vote-KIP-1274-deprecate-classic-rebalance-492b5d4e.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-01-27-mail-discuss-classic-rebalance-deprecation-4c3f8d7a.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-16-mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":21.56,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":78769,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":12115,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.040614899999999995,\\\"input_tokens\\\":58,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1690}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31cf1b52-5ac5-403e-a883-476dd81dc039","uuid":"d0c6f3ca-fe01-454f-bbc4-4d73608ffbf6","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:45:02.003Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the log level settled on for the message recommending users switch off the classic consumer group rebalance protocol in the first phase of deprecation is **INFO**.\\\\n\\\\nThis is found in the discussion thread for KIP-1274. In a message from Lianet Magrans on February 16, 2026, she responds to Matthias Sax's question about Phase 1 logging:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"About phase 1: I think the main goal at this point is to clearly communicate the recommendation in applications not using the new protocol. We can achieve that via an info message (and introduce the warn when we deprecate, as in the KIP), so agreed. Updated phase 1 with this.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nShe confirms that Phase 1 would use an INFO level log to communicate the recommendation to users, with the WARN level being introduced in Phase 2 when the protocol is officially deprecated.\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-16-mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md`\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-23-vote-KIP-1274-deprecate-classic-rebalance-492b5d4e.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-01-27-mail-discuss-classic-rebalance-deprecation-4c3f8d7a.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-16-mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":21.56,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":78769,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":12115,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.040614899999999995,\\\"input_tokens\\\":58,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1690}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the log level settled on for the message recommending users switch off the classic consumer group rebalance protocol in the first phase of deprecation is **INFO**.\\n\\nThis is found in the discussion thread for KIP-1274. In a message from Lianet Magrans on February 16, 2026, she responds to Matthias Sax's question about Phase 1 logging:\\n\\n> \\\"About phase 1: I think the main goal at this point is to clearly communicate the recommendation in applications not using the new protocol. We can achieve that via an info message (and introduce the warn when we deprecate, as in the KIP), so agreed. Updated phase 1 with this.\\\"\\n\\nShe confirms that Phase 1 would use an INFO level log to communicate the recommendation to users, with the WARN level being introduced in Phase 2 when the protocol is officially deprecated.\\n\\n**Source:** `/store/kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-16-mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md`\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-23-vote-KIP-1274-deprecate-classic-rebalance-492b5d4e.md\",\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-01-27-mail-discuss-classic-rebalance-deprecation-4c3f8d7a.md\",\"kips/KIP-1274/2026-02-16-mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md\"],\"seconds\":21.56,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":78769,\"cache_write_tokens\":12115,\"cost_usd\":0.040614899999999995,\"input_tokens\":58,\"output_tokens\":1690}}"}}}
